# Logan Faust, ex Bushido-ArmaTech board, hiding above his private cryo lab.
# Flags: faust_allied (persuade), faust_extorted (intimidate), KnowsAbout(cryo_lab|golden_ticket|ticket_scam), PodFree(4).

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('faust_warned')
goto: Warned

cond: HasFlag('faust_sold_out') && !HasFlag('ebi_strike_landed')
goto: SoldOut

cond: HasFlag('faust_allied')
goto: AlliedReturn

cond: HasFlag('faust_extorted')
goto: ExtortedReturn

cond: HasFlag('faust_persuade_failed')
goto: PersuadeFailedReturn

cond: HasFlag('Killed(mansion_guard)') || HasFlag('Killed(mira_sykes)')
goto: GuardsDead

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (He doesn't get up from the desk.)
+ I know why you are here. Sit, or shoot. Either way you have questions first. Everyone does.
#
o_text: Why does E. want you dead?
o_id: why_ebi
o_goto: Backstory
#
o_text: I'm not here to kill you.
o_id: not_here_to_kill
o_goto: NotKill
#
o_text: Your life has a price. Pay it.
o_id: extort_direct
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Easy')
o_succ: ExtortSuccess
o_fail: ExtortFail
#
o_text: Nothing personal.
o_id: kill_faust
o_goto: KillFaust
#
o_text: I'll think about it.
o_id: faust_leave
o_goto: End

name: GuardsDead
npc: (He stands behind the desk, hands raised, very still.)
+ You came through my people. Of course you did. E. does not hire poets.
+ Ask what you came to ask. I would rather you knew before you decide.
#
o_text: Why does E. want you dead?
o_id: why_ebi_guards_dead
o_goto: Backstory
#
o_text: I'm not here to kill you.
o_id: not_here_to_kill_guards_dead
o_goto: NotKill
#
o_text: Your life has a price. Pay it.
o_id: extort_guards_dead
o_goto: ExtortSuccess
#
o_text: Nothing personal.
o_id: kill_faust_guards_dead
o_goto: KillFaust

name: Backstory
npc: Because I read the plan. Eschaton calls it the cleansing: one pulse to kill every chip on the planet,
+ then their holy friends finish the job with warheads. The board applauded. I resigned the same night.
+ And the golden ticket, the million sat for a berth to the stars? There are no berths.
+ The ships lift with cargo and crew. Nobody is buying a way out. They are buying silence.
effect: SetFlag('KnowsAbout(golden_ticket)')
effect: SetFlag('KnowsAbout(ticket_scam)')
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: NotKill
npc: Then what? E. pays in sat. What do I pay in?
#
o_text: A way out. For both of us. You have one, or you wouldn't still be here.
o_id: persuade_faust
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Hard')
o_succ: AlliedSuccess
o_fail: PersuadeFail
#
o_text: Your cryo notes on the desk. That glycol ratio will crystallise in your veins. You need someone who can fix the mix.
o_id: fix_mix_faust
o_test: RollSkill('biochemistry', 'Hard')
o_succ: MixFixed
o_fail: PersuadeFail
#
o_text: Everything you own, for starters.
o_id: extort_faust
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Easy')
o_succ: ExtortSuccess
o_fail: ExtortFail
#
o_text: Forget it.
o_id: forget_it
o_goto: Default

name: PersuadeFail
npc: A way out. (A dry laugh.) The last man who said that to me sits on the EBI board.
+ Get out of my study.
effect: SetFlag('faust_persuade_failed')
#
o_text: What would it take?
o_id: ask_condition
o_cond: !HasFlag('Killed(mansion_guard)')
o_goto: Condition
#
o_text: Name your price, then.
o_id: ask_condition_guards_dead
o_cond: HasFlag('Killed(mansion_guard)')
o_goto: NoCondition
#
o_text: Then I'll take it from you.
o_id: extort_after_fail
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Easy')
o_succ: ExtortSuccess
o_fail: ExtortFail
#
o_text: Nothing personal.
o_id: kill_after_fail
o_goto: KillFaust
#
o_text: Your loss.
o_id: leave_after_fail
o_goto: End

name: Condition
npc: Proof you are not E.'s. The south gate logs what leaves the city: bring me EBI's copy and I know who sent you.
+ Or make Mira vouch for you. She has never vouched for anyone.
#
o_text: I have the log.
o_id: show_log
o_cond: HasItem('gate_log')
o_goto: LogAccepted
#
o_text: Understood.
o_id: condition_ok
o_goto: End

name: NoCondition
npc: Nothing you have. My people are cooling in the drive. Take, or shoot, or leave.
#
o_text: Then I'll take it from you.
o_id: extort_no_condition
o_goto: ExtortSuccess
#
o_text: Your loss.
o_id: leave_no_condition
o_goto: End

name: PersuadeFailedReturn
npc: You again. The gate log, or Mira's word. Otherwise we have nothing to discuss.
#
o_text: I have the log.
o_id: show_log_return
o_cond: HasItem('gate_log') && !HasFlag('Killed(mansion_guard)')
o_goto: LogAccepted
#
o_text: Ask Mira. The gate guards stopped skimming her budget today.
o_id: mira_vouches
o_cond: HasFlag('mira_favour') && !HasFlag('Killed(mansion_guard)')
o_goto: MiraVouches
#
o_text: Then I'll take it from you.
o_id: extort_return_fail
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Easy')
o_succ: ExtortSuccess
o_fail: ExtortFail
#
o_text: Nothing personal.
o_id: kill_return_fail
o_goto: KillFaust
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: leave_return_fail
o_goto: End

name: MixFixed
npc: (He checks your numbers against his, twice, and goes pale.) Three years of work, and I would have woken up as slush.
+ All right. You've earned a hearing.
#
o_text: Now talk.
o_id: mix_now_talk
o_goto: AlliedSuccess

name: LogAccepted
npc: (He reads it twice.) No EBI plate on any of this. You came the hard way, then.
+ All right.
effect: RemoveItem('gate_log')
#
o_text: Now talk.
o_id: log_now_talk
o_goto: AlliedSuccess

name: MiraVouches
npc: (He glances at the door; Mira nods once.) Six years, and she never did that. All right.
#
o_text: Now talk.
o_id: mira_now_talk
o_goto: AlliedSuccess

name: SoldOut
npc: (He reads your face before you speak.) Something has changed. Say it.
#
o_text: E. knows where you are. A team is an hour out. Take Mira and go below.
o_id: warn_faust
o_goto: Warn
#
o_text: Nothing. Just checking in.
o_id: sold_out_leave
o_goto: End

name: Warn
npc: (He is already on his feet.) You sold me and then you came back. I won't ask which one you meant.
+ Mira! The cellar. Leave the door; our friend may need it.
effect: SetFlag('faust_warned')
effect: ClearFlag('cryo_keycard')
effect: MoveTo(NPC, 'cryo_lab', 'pod_room')
effect: MoveTo(ActorWithName('mira_sykes'), 'cryo_lab', 'pod_room')
#
o_text: Go.
o_id: warn_go
o_goto: End

name: Warned
npc: We are below. If they come down the stairs, they came for you, not me.
#
o_text: Which pod is mine?
o_id: ask_pod_warned
o_cond: HasFlag('faust_allied') && !HasFlag('PodFree(4)')
o_goto: PodOffer
#
o_text: Tell me about E. again.
o_id: why_ebi_warned
o_goto: Backstory
#
o_text: I'll watch the stairs.
o_id: warned_leave
o_goto: End

name: ExtortFail
npc: No. (He straightens for the first time.) Shoot me, then, and explain to E. why the cellar is still locked.
#
o_text: Fine. Let's talk instead.
o_id: talk_instead
o_goto: NotKill
#
o_text: Nothing personal.
o_id: kill_after_extort_fail
o_goto: KillFaust
#
o_text: I'll be back.
o_id: leave_after_extort_fail
o_goto: End

name: AlliedSuccess
npc: (He studies you for a long moment, then slides a card across the desk.)
+ Under this house is a cryo lab. Four pods, an AI called ARK, power for two hundred years.
+ When the sky burns, the people in those pods wake up afterwards. Nobody else does.
+ The card opens the cellar behind the kitchen. Don't make me regret this.
effect: PlayerAddItem('cryo_keycard')
effect: SetFlag('faust_allied')
effect: SetFlag('KnowsAbout(cryo_lab)')
effect: SetFlag('KnowsAbout(golden_ticket)')
effect: SetFlag('KnowsAbout(ticket_scam)')
#
o_text: Which pod is mine?
o_id: ask_pod
o_goto: PodOffer
#
o_text: Why trust me?
o_id: why_trust
o_goto: WhyTrust
#
o_text: I'll see myself out.
o_id: allied_leave
o_goto: End

name: PodOffer
npc: Four. It was mine. I have had my years; most of them were bad.
+ One and two hold old colleagues who deserve it less than you. Three is dead; EBI saw to that.
effect: SetFlag('PodFree(4)')
#
o_text: I won't forget this.
o_id: pod_thanks
o_goto: End

name: WhyTrust
npc: I don't. But you came in with a question instead of a gun, and I am tired of guns.
#
o_text: Fair.
o_id: trust_fair
o_goto: AlliedSuccessOptions

name: AlliedSuccessOptions
npc: Anything else?
#
o_text: Which pod is mine?
o_id: ask_pod_again
o_cond: !HasFlag('PodFree(4)')
o_goto: PodOffer
#
o_text: No.
o_id: allied_done
o_goto: End

name: ExtortSuccess
npc: (His hands shake as he empties the drawer.)
+ Two thousand. And the card for the cellar door. There is a cryo lab under the house; ARK runs it.
+ Take it. Take all of it. Just go.
effect: PlayerAddGold(2000)
effect: PlayerAddItem('cryo_keycard')
effect: SetFlag('faust_extorted')
effect: SetFlag('KnowsAbout(cryo_lab)')
effect: SetFlag('KnowsAbout(golden_ticket)')
effect: SetFlag('KnowsAbout(ticket_scam)')
#
o_text: Pleasure doing business.
o_id: extort_done
o_goto: End
#
o_text: Now the rest of it. Why does E. want you dead?
o_id: extort_backstory
o_goto: Backstory

name: AlliedReturn
npc: Still alive, I see. Both of us.
#
o_text: Which pod is mine?
o_id: ask_pod_return
o_cond: !HasFlag('PodFree(4)')
o_goto: PodOffer
#
o_text: Tell me about E. again.
o_id: why_ebi_return
o_goto: Backstory
#
o_text: Just checking in.
o_id: allied_return_leave
o_goto: End

name: ExtortedReturn
npc: You have what you wanted. Leave me.
#
o_text: Nothing personal.
o_id: kill_faust_return
o_goto: KillFaust
#
o_text: (Leave.)
o_id: extorted_return_leave
o_goto: End

name: KillFaust
npc: (He closes his eyes.) It never is.
effect: StartCombat

name: End
npc: (He turns back to the window.)
effect: EndConversation
